♪♪"}, {"start": 125.9939, "end": 127.9939, "text": "Abed, guess who's got two thumbs"}, {"start": 127.9939, "end": 130.9939, "text": "and has an exciting career opportunity for you?"}, {"start": 130.9939, "end": 132.9939, "text": "This guy."}, {"start": 132.9939, "end": 134.9939, "text": "I'm pointing my thumbs at God."}, {"start": 134.9939, "end": 136.9939, "text": "I'm using one thumb to say that's great."}, {"start": 136.9939, "end": 139.9939, "text": "I told my pastor about YouTube and how there's no light there for the kids,"}, {"start": 139.9939, "end": 141.4939, "text": "and our church wants to sponsor the making"}, {"start": 141.4939, "end": 142.9939, "text": "of a viral video with a Christian message."}, {"start": 142.9939, "end": 144.9939, "text": "What are you gonna do, wrapping Jesus?"}, {"start": 144.9939, "end": 147.9939, "text": "Yes, please just step aside and make room for a new generation."}, {"start": 147.9939, "end": 150.9939, "text": "Um, Abed, would you like to make a Christian YouTube?"}, {"start": 150.9939, "end": 151.9939, "text": "I know you're Muslim, but..."}, {"start": 151.9939, "end": 152.9939, "text": "As a Muslim, I'd be happy to do it."}, {"start": 152.9939, "end": 153.9939, "text": "As a filmmaker, no way."}, {"start": 153.9939, "end": 155.9939, "text": "I'm a storyteller, not a preacher."}, {"start": 155.9939, "end": 158.9939, "text": "Well, but the Bible has been called the greatest story ever told."}, {"start": 158.9939, "end": 160.9939, "text": "Ben Lyons said the same thing about \"I am Legend.\""}, {"start": 160.9939, "end": 164.9939, "text": "Oh, well, I'll have to rent that bill."}, {"start": 164.9939, "end": 165.9939, "text": "Whoa!"}, {"start": 165.9939, "end": 166.9939, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 166.9939, "end": 168.9939, "text": "It's a lot of pasta for no veggies."}, {"start": 168.9939, "end": 169.9939, "text": "You're not in charge of what I eat."}, {"start": 169.9939, "end": 170.9939, "text": "That's true."}, {"start": 170.9939, "end": 175.9939, "text": "Right up."}, {"start": 175.9939, "end": 178.9939, "text": "And some damn broccoli, please."}, {"start": 178.9939, "end": 180.9939, "text": "Pierce has been acting out a lot lately."}, {"start": 180.9939, "end": 182.9939, "text": "Maybe you should talk to him."}, {"start": 182.9939, "end": 184.9939, "text": "How is that my job?"}, {"start": 184.9939, "end": 186.9939, "text": "Aren't you, like, the dad?"}, {"start": 186.9939, "end": 188.9939, "text": "Would the dad walk away from this conversation?"}, {"start": 188.9939, "end": 190.9939, "text": "No."}, {"start": 195.9939, "end": 196.9939, "text": "You're having cookies for lunch?"}, {"start": 196.9939, "end": 197.9939, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 197.9939, "end": 198.9939, "text": "Hey, you didn't pay for those."}, {"start": 198.9939, "end": 202.9939, "text": "Call a cop."}, {"start": 202.9939, "end": 203.66056666666665, "text": "Heads up, K."}, {"start": 203.66056666666665, "end": 203.9939, "text": "Watts."}, {"start": 203.9939, "end": 204.9939, "text": "Oh, yeah, me."}, {"start": 204.9939, "end": 206.9939, "text": "Who better one than me?"}, {"start": 206.9939, "end": 210.9939, "text": "Fresh and stolen."}, {"start": 210.9939, "end": 212.9939, "text": "What are you looking at?"}, {"start": 212.9939, "end": 213.9939, "text": "Your face."}, {"start": 213.9939, "end": 215.9939, "text": "That's what you're supposed to look at."}, {"start": 215.9939, "end": 216.9939, "text": "So?"}, {"start": 216.9939, "end": 217.9939, "text": "So?"}, {"start": 217.9939, "end": 218.9939, "text": "You kind of sit down or what?"}, {"start": 218.9939, "end": 219.9939, "text": "Oh, no."}, {"start": 219.9939, "end": 221.9939, "text": "I usually sit with the younger people."}, {"start": 221.9939, "end": 224.9939, "text": "Well, la-ti-da-ti-da."}, {"start": 224.9939, "end": 226.9939, "text": "No, no, we watch videos on YouTube, and you"}, {"start": 226.9939, "end": 228.9939, "text": "guys probably don't even know what that is."}, {"start": 228.9939, "end": 229.9939, "text": "We don't care."}, {"start": 229.9939, "end": 230.9939, "text": "Pierce, are you looking for us?"}, {"start": 230.9939, "end": 231.9939, "text": "We're sitting over there."}, {"start": 231.9939, "end": 232.9939, "text": "I can see."}, {"start": 232.9939, "end": 233.9939, "text": "Sheesh."}, {"start": 233.9939, "end": 235.9939, "text": "Did you take your pills?"}, {"start": 235.9939, "end": 236.9939, "text": "Ooh."}, {"start": 236.9939, "end": 237.9939, "text": "Me mama's boy."}, {"start": 237.9939, "end": 239.9939, "text": "We're having a private conversation here."}, {"start": 239.9939, "end": 240.9939, "text": "Oh."}, {"start": 240.9939, "end": 241.9939, "text": "Oh, I'm sorry."}, {"start": 241.9939, "end": 242.9939, "text": "Hi."}, {"start": 242.9939, "end": 243.9939, "text": "I'm Britta."}, {"start": 243.9939, "end": 245.9939, "text": "Pierce is..."}, {"start": 245.9939, "end": 250.9939, "text": "Very nice meeting you guys."}, {"start": 250.9939, "end": 252.9939, "text": "Very nice meeting you guys."}, {"start": 252.9939, "end": 254.9939, "text": "Ooh."}, {"start": 254.9939, "end": 256.9939, "text": "She's a lesbian."}, {"start": 256.9939, "end": 257.9939, "text": "Come on."}, {"start": 264.9939, "end": 266.9939, "text": "Shirley, I read the New Testament."}, {"start": 266.9939, "end": 268.9939, "text": "The whole thing?"}, {"start": 268.9939, "end": 270.4257181818182, "text": "You know, being raised by TV and movies, I"}, {"start": 270.4257181818182, "end": 271.9939, "text": "always thought that Jesus just walked on water"}, {"start": 271.9939, "end": 274.9939, "text": "and told people not to have abortions, but it's so much cooler than that."}, {"start": 274.9939, "end": 277.9939, "text": "He was like E.T., Edward Scissorhands, and Marty McFly combined."}, {"start": 277.9939, "end": 279.9939, "text": "I would love to make a Jesus movie."}, {"start": 279.9939, "end": 281.9939, "text": "Oh, Abba, that's wonderful."}, {"start": 281.9939, "end": 283.9939, "text": "Well, what do you think we should do?"}, {"start": 283.9939, "end": 287.9939, "text": "It needs to be cool and addictive, like that video of the kitten falling asleep."}, {"start": 287.9939, "end": 288.9939, "text": "Absolutely."}, {"start": 288.9939, "end": 290.9939, "text": "But the story's been told to death, so I want to approach it in a new way."}, {"start": 290.9939, "end": 293.9939, "text": "We need a Jesus movie for the post-postmodern world."}, {"start": 293.9939, "end": 296.9939, "text": "Like Jesus as a rapper?"}, {"start": 296.9939, "end": 298.9939, "text": "No."}, {"start": 298.9939, "end": 300.7258587628866, "text": "I want to tell the story of Jesus from the"}, {"start": 300.7258587628866, "end": 302.9939, "text": "perspective of a filmmaker exploring the life of Jesus."}, {"start": 302.9939, "end": 305.9939, "text": "That sounds very appealing to filmmakers."}, {"start": 305.9939, "end": 307.4056647058824, "text": "See, in the filmmaker's film, Jesus is a"}, {"start": 307.4056647058824, "end": 308.9939, "text": "filmmaker trying to find God with his camera."}, {"start": 308.9939, "end": 311.09916315789474, "text": "But then the filmmaker realizes that he's actually"}, {"start": 311.09916315789474, "end": 312.9939, "text": "Jesus, and he's being filmed by God's camera."}, {"start": 312.9939, "end": 314.9939, "text": "And it goes like that forever in both directions, like a mirror in a mirror,"}, {"start": 314.9939, "end": 317.9939, "text": "because all of the filmmakers are Jesus, and all of their cameras are God."}, {"start": 317.9939, "end": 320.9939, "text": "And the movie's called Abbad."}, {"start": 320.9939, "end": 321.9939, "text": "All caps."}, {"start": 321.9939, "end": 323.9939, "text": "Filmmaking beyond film."}, {"start": 323.9939, "end": 324.9939, "text": "A meta-film."}, {"start": 324.9939, "end": 326.9939, "text": "My masterpiece."}, {"start": 326.9939, "end": 329.9939, "text": "I don't like it."}, {"start": 329.9939, "end": 330.9539, "text": "Well, that's okay."}, {"start": 330.9539, "end": 333.9939, "text": "You know, you're reacting the way the world did to Jesus."}, {"start": 333.9939, "end": 335.78213529411767, "text": "I'm reacting the way the world does to"}, {"start": 335.78213529411767, "end": 337.9939, "text": "movies about making movies about making movies."}, {"start": 337.9939, "end": 339.3317378378378, "text": "I mean, come on, Charlie Kaufman."}, {"start": 339.3317378378378, "end": 340.7911972972973, "text": "Some of us have work in the morning."}, {"start": 340.7911972972973, "end": 340.9939, "text": "Damn."}, {"start": 340.9939, "end": 342.9939, "text": "Does this mean you don't want to work on the movie?"}, {"start": 342.9939, "end": 345.9939, "text": "This means there is no movie."}, {"start": 350.9939, "end": 353.9939, "text": "This is the movie."}, {"start": 353.9939, "end": 356.9939, "text": "The game is jacks and deuces wild."}, {"start": 356.9939, "end": 360.9939, "text": "Except if the dean comes in and then it's bingo."}, {"start": 361.9939, "end": 362.9169769230769, "text": "Keep it."}, {"start": 362.9169769230769, "end": 364.9939, "text": "I got another one."}, {"start": 364.9939, "end": 368.9939, "text": "If you get caught with that, just say it's your 90th birthday."}, {"start": 368.9939, "end": 371.9939, "text": "Suddenly, it's adorable."}, {"start": 371.9939, "end": 372.9939, "text": "That's right."}, {"start": 372.9939, "end": 374.26662727272725, "text": "All right now."}, {"start": 374.26662727272725, "end": 375.9939, "text": "What is this again?"}, {"start": 376.9939, "end": 377.9939, "text": "B19."}, {"start": 377.9939, "end": 379.5752953488372, "text": "No, B19, my butt."}, {"start": 379.5752953488372, "end": 381.9939, "text": "I told you guys, no poker."}, {"start": 381.9939, "end": 383.9939, "text": "All right, shut this down."}, {"start": 383.9939, "end": 386.9939, "text": "Shut your mouth down, fruit."}, {"start": 386.9939, "end": 390.9939, "text": "A, unacceptable, and none of your business and barely the whole truth."}, {"start": 390.9939, "end": 393.9939, "text": "All right, everyone, go home."}, {"start": 393.9939, "end": 394.9939, "text": "Excuse me, mister."}, {"start": 394.9939, "end": 396.9939, "text": "What, pierce?"}, {"start": 396.9939, "end": 397.9939, "text": "What year is it?"}, {"start": 397.9939, "end": 398.9939, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 398.9939, "end": 401.9939, "text": "Poker helps him remember."}, {"start": 401.9939, "end": 403.9939, "text": "Veronica."}, {"start": 405.9939, "end": 406.9939, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 406.9939, "end": 407.9939, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 416.9939, "end": 418.3015923076923, "text": "Shut up and deal."}, {"start": 418.3015923076923, "end": 418.9939, "text": "Let's go."}, {"start": 418.9939, "end": 421.2439, "text": "Jesus, did you really die for our sins?"}, {"start": 421.2439, "end": 421.9939, "text": "That's dopey."}, {"start": 421.9939, "end": 422.9939, "text": "Dope."}, {"start": 422.9939, "end": 424.9939, "text": "Oh, Freudian slip."}, {"start": 424.9939, "end": 426.9939, "text": "Perhaps due to my feeling kind of dopey."}, {"start": 426.9939, "end": 428.9939, "text": "Due the line, atheist."}, {"start": 428.9939, "end": 432.05272352941176, "text": "Jesus, did you really die for our sins?"}, {"start": 432.05272352941176, "end": 432.9939, "text": "That's dope."}, {"start": 432.9939, "end": 434.9939, "text": "You think that's dope?"}, {"start": 434.9939, "end": 437.9939, "text": "Check out these beatitudes."}, {"start": 444.9939, "end": 446.9939, "text": "Blessed be the peacemaker's word to the meek."}, {"start": 446.9939, "end": 448.9939, "text": "The kingdom of heaven is open on weak."}, {"start": 448.9939, "end": 450.9939, "text": "Jesus is not real."}, {"start": 450.9939, "end": 452.9939, "text": "I have arrived."}, {"start": 452.9939, "end": 455.9939, "text": "I am watched as I am watching."}, {"start": 455.9939, "end": 459.9939, "text": "I am audience and creation."}, {"start": 461.9939, "end": 463.9939, "text": "The earth shall know my power."}, {"start": 463.9939, "end": 465.9939, "text": "Abed, what are you doing?"}, {"start": 465.9939, "end": 466.4939, "text": "Great."}, {"start": 466.4939, "end": 467.9939, "text": "You blew the take."}, {"start": 467.9939, "end": 469.0439, "text": "No, no."}, {"start": 469.0439, "end": 470.9939, "text": "Keep rolling."}, {"start": 471.9939, "end": 473.9939, "text": "This can all be part of it."}, {"start": 474.9939, "end": 475.9939, "text": "There are no takes."}, {"start": 475.9939, "end": 477.9939, "text": "There is no viewer."}, {"start": 477.9939, "end": 480.3096894736842, "text": "The film is the story."}, {"start": 480.3096894736842, "end": 481.9939, "text": "The story is us."}, {"start": 481.9939, "end": 483.9939, "text": "We are the film."}, {"start": 483.9939, "end": 485.9939, "text": "This is totally meta."}, {"start": 485.9939, "end": 487.9939, "text": "Well, let's get back to our non-meta production, shall we?"}, {"start": 487.9939, "end": 488.9939, "text": "Go ahead."}, {"start": 488.9939, "end": 489.9939, "text": "No, I want to watch this."}, {"start": 489.9939, "end": 491.9939, "text": "Troy, there's no time."}, {"start": 491.9939, "end": 493.9939, "text": "Then we quit."}, {"start": 493.9939, "end": 494.9939, "text": "Right, Britta?"}, {"start": 494.9939, "end": 497.9939, "text": "I don't even believe in God, but I love Nisa Mabad."}, {"start": 497.9939, "end": 498.9939, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 498.9939, "end": 499.9939, "text": "What are you?"}, {"start": 499.9939, "end": 500.9939, "text": "What?"}, {"start": 508.9939, "end": 513.1081857142857, "text": "The story of the"}, {"start": 513.1081857142857, "end": 517.9938999999999, "text": "story is the story."}, {"start": 517.9938999999999, "end": 518.2880176470587, "text": "Sure."}, {"start": 518.2880176470587, "end": 519.9938999999999, "text": "That'll play in Poughkeepsie."}, {"start": 519.9938999999999, "end": 522.9938999999999, "text": "I heard some theaters are going to show it in reverse."}, {"start": 522.9938999999999, "end": 525.9938999999999, "text": "I heard it's the same movie, backward and forward."}, {"start": 525.9938999999999, "end": 527.9938999999999, "text": "I heard the deleted scenes are the scenes,"}, {"start": 527.9938999999999, "end": 529.9938999999999, "text": "and the scenes are the deleted scenes."}, {"start": 529.9938999999999, "end": 531.9938999999999, "text": "I heard Jesus died for our sins."}, {"start": 531.9938999999999, "end": 533.9938999999999, "text": "Okay, guys."}, {"start": 533.9938999999999, "end": 536.9938999999999, "text": "The director's answering questions in the cafeteria,"}, {"start": 536.9938999999999, "end": 539.9938999999999, "text": "and it both is and isn't part of the movie."}, {"start": 539.9938999999999, "end": 541.9938999999999, "text": "Get a table."}, {"start": 543.9938999999999, "end": 547.9938999999999, "text": "Abed, are we all in the movie right now?"}, {"start": 547.9938999999999, "end": 551.9938999999999, "text": "We are all in a movie, even when there are no cameras."}, {"start": 551.9938999999999, "end": 554.9938999999999, "text": "When will the movie be released?"}, {"start": 554.9938999999999, "end": 556.9938999999999, "text": "When is life released?"}, {"start": 556.9938999999999, "end": 558.9938999999999, "text": "Every minute of our lives is a world premiere,"}, {"start": 558.9938999999999, "end": 561.9938999999999, "text": "and my father's already bought the popcorn."}, {"start": 561.9938999999999, "end": 563.9938999999999, "text": "Excuse me, Abed,"}, {"start": 563.9938999999999, "end": 568.9938999999999, "text": "but you aren't actually trying to say that you're Jesus, are you?"}, {"start": 568.9938999999999, "end": 570.9938999999999, "text": "I am who you say I am."}, {"start": 570.9938999999999, "end": 573.9938999999999, "text": "Oh, man."}, {"start": 573.9938999999999, "end": 575.9938999999999, "text": "Oh, hey, yeah."}, {"start": 575.9938999999999, "end": 577.9938999999999, "text": "Ooh, it's madder now."}, {"start": 577.9938999999999, "end": 578.9938999999999, "text": "So here's the thing."}, {"start": 578.9938999999999, "end": 579.9938999999999, "text": "I'm a devout Christian,"}, {"start": 579.9938999999999, "end": 583.9938999999999, "text": "and you guys are feeding into this poor boy's delusions."}, {"start": 583.9938999999999, "end": 584.9938999999999, "text": "So cool."}, {"start": 584.9938999999999, "end": 587.9938999999999, "text": "She's an actual real-life Pharisee."}, {"start": 587.9938999999999, "end": 588.9938999999999, "text": "Hey, bitch."}, {"start": 588.9938999999999, "end": 590.9938999999999, "text": "Why don't you go back to your temple?"}, {"start": 590.9938999999999, "end": 591.9938999999999, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 591.9938999999999, "end": 594.9938999999999, "text": "Why don't you all stop confusing Jesus"}, {"start": 594.9938999999999, "end": 597.9938999999999, "text": "with an egotistical filmmaking lunatic?"}, {"start": 600.9938999999999, "end": 601.9938999999999, "text": "I forgive her."}, {"start": 617.5459999999999, "end": 621.406, "text": "So, how's your film going, Knobed?"}, {"start": 621.406, "end": 622.406, "text": "Blasphemously."}, {"start": 622.406, "end": 626.286, "text": "It's not blasphemy to say that we are God, Shirley."}, {"start": 626.286, "end": 631.986, "text": "First Corinthians, \"He who unites himself with the Lord is one with him in spirit.\""}, {"start": 631.986, "end": 634.0459999999999, "text": "Did you just scripture me, Muslim?"}, {"start": 634.0459999999999, "end": 635.0459999999999, "text": "Jesus was Jewish."}, {"start": 635.0459999999999, "end": 637.7259999999999, "text": "Are you able to go and let that go?"}, {"start": 637.7259999999999, "end": 641.8059999999999, "text": "Hey, no religious talk."}, {"start": 641.8059999999999, "end": 642.8059999999999, "text": "Somebody's late."}, {"start": 642.8059999999999, "end": 644.8059999999999, "text": "What is that in your pocket?"}, {"start": 644.8059999999999, "end": 649.5859999999999, "text": "Jeff Britta, Pierce is smoking cigars."}, {"start": 649.5859999999999, "end": 650.5859999999999, "text": "What's it to you, butt breath?"}, {"start": 650.5859999999999, "end": 651.5859999999999, "text": "Oh."}, {"start": 651.5859999999999, "end": 652.5859999999999, "text": "Look at your eyes."}, {"start": 652.5859999999999, "end": 654.246, "text": "Have you been out all night with those hipsters?"}, {"start": 654.246, "end": 655.246, "text": "Hipsters?"}, {"start": 655.246, "end": 657.3259999999999, "text": "They pack up old people that hang out in the cafeteria."}, {"start": 657.3259999999999, "end": 659.386, "text": "People call them hipsters because they all have hip replacements."}, {"start": 659.386, "end": 661.3059999999999, "text": "They do not."}, {"start": 661.3059999999999, "end": 663.9259999999999, "text": "Leonard would probably kick your ass."}, {"start": 663.9259999999999, "end": 667.5659999999999, "text": "Leonard, you're hanging out with Leonard?"}, {"start": 667.5659999999999, "end": 669.126, "text": "You know I hate him."}, {"start": 669.126, "end": 670.126, "text": "So?"}, {"start": 670.126, "end": 671.126, "text": "Everybody hates him."}, {"start": 671.126, "end": 673.1659999999999, "text": "That's why he's cool."}, {"start": 673.1659999999999, "end": 674.1659999999999, "text": "You people don't get it."}, {"start": 674.1659999999999, "end": 676.606, "text": "Well, Pierce, I'm not sure that I want to get it."}, {"start": 676.606, "end": 679.0859999999999, "text": "And I think you ought to take a break from these new friends of yours."}, {"start": 679.0859999999999, "end": 680.7259999999999, "text": "They've got you all riled up."}, {"start": 680.7259999999999, "end": 682.246, "text": "That's what Leonard said you'd say."}, {"start": 682.246, "end": 684.8459999999999, "text": "Well, Leonard is not a part of this study group."}, {"start": 684.8459999999999, "end": 687.7724150943395, "text": "So you apologize right now to ..."}, {"start": 687.7724150943395, "end": 689.5459999999999, "text": "I'm not your father."}, {"start": 689.5459999999999, "end": 691.406, "text": "I never said you were."}, {"start": 691.406, "end": 692.406, "text": "Where are you going?"}, {"start": 692.406, "end": 693.406, "text": "Out!"}, {"start": 693.406, "end": 696.646, "text": "Uh, when did Pierce become awesome?"}, {"start": 696.646, "end": 698.2059999999999, "text": "I am going to shut you down."}, {"start": 698.2059999999999, "end": 699.2059999999999, "text": "You know that?"}, {"start": 699.2059999999999, "end": 700.2059999999999, "text": "I do."}, {"start": 700.2059999999999, "end": 701.2059999999999, "text": "Oh, oh, I get it."}, {"start": 701.2059999999999, "end": 702.2059999999999, "text": "I'm supposed to shut you down."}, {"start": 702.2059999999999, "end": 703.2059999999999, "text": "Why?"}, {"start": 703.2059999999999, "end": 704.2059999999999, "text": "Well, I'm supposed to shut you down."}, {"start": 704.2059999999999, "end": 705.2059999999999, "text": "Well, I'm supposed to shut you down."}, {"start": 705.2059999999999, "end": 706.2059999999999, "text": "Good."}, {"start": 706.2059999999999, "end": 707.2059999999999, "text": "He's going to shut you down."}, {"start": 707.2059999999999, "end": 708.2059999999999, "text": "He's going to shut you down."}, {"start": 708.2059999999999, "end": 709.2059999999999, "text": "Good."}, {"start": 709.2059999999999, "end": 710.2059999999999, "text": "He's going to shut you down."}, {"start": 710.2059999999999, "end": 711.2059999999999, "text": "Good."}, {"start": 711.2059999999999, "end": 712.2059999999999, "text": "He's going to shut you down."}, {"start": 712.2059999999999, "end": 713.2059999999999, "text": "He's going to shut you down."}, {"start": 713.2059999999999, "end": 714.2059999999999, "text": "He's going to shut you down."}, {"start": 714.2059999999999, "end": 715.2059999999999, "text": "Good."}, {"start": 715.2059999999999, "end": 716.2059999999999, "text": "He's going to shut you down."}, {"start": 716.2059999999999, "end": 717.2059999999999, "text": "He's going to shut you down."}, {"start": 717.2059999999999, "end": 718.2059999999999, "text": "He's going to shut you down."}, {"start": 718.2059999999999, "end": 719.2059999999999, "text": "He's going to shut you down."}, {"start": 719.2059999999999, "end": 720.2059999999999, "text": "He's going to shut you down."}, {"start": 720.2059999999999, "end": 721.2059999999999, "text": "He's going to shut you down."}, {"start": 721.2059999999999, "end": 722.2059999999999, "text": "He's going to shut you down."}, {"start": 722.2059999999999, "end": 723.2059999999999, "text": "He's going to shut you down."}, {"start": 723.2059999999999, "end": 724.2059999999999, "text": "He's going to shut you down."}, {"start": 724.2059999999999, "end": 725.2059999999999, "text": "He's going to shut you down."}, {"start": 725.2059999999999, "end": 726.2059999999999, "text": "He's going to shut you down."}, {"start": 726.2059999999999, "end": 727.2059999999999, "text": "He's going to shut you down."}, {"start": 734.2059999999999, "end": 735.2059999999999, "text": "He's going to shut you down."}, {"start": 735.2059999999999, "end": 736.2059999999999, "text": "He's going to shut you down."}, {"start": 736.2059999999999, "end": 737.2059999999999, "text": "He's going to shut you down."}, {"start": 737.2059999999999, "end": 738.2059999999999, "text": "He's going to shut you down."}, {"start": 738.2059999999999, "end": 739.2059999999999, "text": "He's going to shut you down."}, {"start": 739.2059999999999, "end": 740.2059999999999, "text": "He's going to shut you down."}, {"start": 740.2059999999999, "end": 741.2059999999999, "text": "He's going to shut you down."}, {"start": 741.2059999999999, "end": 742.2059999999999, "text": "He's going to shut you down."}, {"start": 742.2059999999999, "end": 743.2059999999999, "text": "He's going to shut you down."}, {"start": 743.2059999999999, "end": 744.2059999999999, "text": "He's going to shut you down."}, {"start": 744.2059999999999, "end": 745.2059999999999, "text": "He's going to shut you down."}, {"start": 745.2059999999999, "end": 746.2059999999999, "text": "He's going to shut you down."}, {"start": 746.2059999999999, "end": 747.2059999999999, "text": "He's going to shut you down."}, {"start": 747.2059999999999, "end": 748.2059999999999, "text": "He's going to shut you down."}, {"start": 748.2059999999999, "end": 749.2059999999999, "text": "He's going to shut you down."}, {"start": 749.2059999999999, "end": 750.2059999999999, "text": "He's going to shut you down."}, {"start": 750.2059999999999, "end": 751.2059999999999, "text": "He's going to shut you down."}, {"start": 751.2059999999999, "end": 752.2059999999999, "text": "He's going to shut you down."}, {"start": 752.2059999999999, "end": 753.2059999999999, "text": "He's going to shut you down."}, {"start": 753.2059999999999, "end": 754.2059999999999, "text": "He's going to shut you down."}, {"start": 754.2059999999999, "end": 755.2059999999999, "text": "He's going to shut you down."}, {"start": 755.2059999999999, "end": 756.2059999999999, "text": "He's going to shut you down."}, {"start": 764.2059999999999, "end": 765.2059999999999, "text": "What year is it?"}, {"start": 767.2059999999999, "end": 768.2059999999999, "text": "We've all been drinking."}, {"start": 768.2059999999999, "end": 770.2059999999999, "text": "Oh, grow a shmeckle."}, {"start": 774.2059999999999, "end": 775.2059999999999, "text": "Hey, everyone, this is the last scene."}, {"start": 775.2059999999999, "end": 777.6217303370786, "text": "I want to thank you all for contributing in"}, {"start": 777.6217303370786, "end": 780.2059999999999, "text": "your small way to the greatest film ever made."}, {"start": 780.2059999999999, "end": 783.2059999999999, "text": "And on the seventh day, Shirley shut down production."}, {"start": 783.2059999999999, "end": 786.2605454545453, "text": "Abed, Shirley has informed her that you are using school"}, {"start": 786.2605454545453, "end": 789.2059999999999, "text": "equipment on school property to make a religious film."}, {"start": 789.2059999999999, "end": 793.2059999999999, "text": "She has filed an official complaint invoking the separation of church and state."}, {"start": 793.2059999999999, "end": 795.2059999999999, "text": "I point out the irony to her already."}, {"start": 795.2059999999999, "end": 796.2059999999999, "text": "Don't give a crap."}, {"start": 796.2059999999999, "end": 797.2059999999999, "text": "Let's be ironic."}, {"start": 797.2059999999999, "end": 798.2059999999999, "text": "Shut it down."}, {"start": 798.2059999999999, "end": 801.2059999999999, "text": "Abed, are you making a religious film?"}, {"start": 801.2059999999999, "end": 803.2059999999999, "text": "All movies are religious to me."}, {"start": 803.2059999999999, "end": 804.2059999999999, "text": "Nice."}, {"start": 804.2059999999999, "end": 806.2059999999999, "text": "But is it a movie about Jesus?"}, {"start": 806.2059999999999, "end": 807.2059999999999, "text": "Is The Matrix?"}, {"start": 807.2059999999999, "end": 809.2059999999999, "text": "Is Robocop?"}, {"start": 809.2059999999999, "end": 811.2059999999999, "text": "Is Superman Returns?"}, {"start": 811.2059999999999, "end": 813.2059999999999, "text": "All stories are about death and resurrection."}, {"start": 813.2059999999999, "end": 814.2059999999999, "text": "I've got one."}, {"start": 814.2059999999999, "end": 815.2059999999999, "text": "Wrath of Khan?"}, {"start": 815.2059999999999, "end": 816.2059999999999, "text": "That's a good one."}, {"start": 816.2059999999999, "end": 819.2059999999999, "text": "Spock sacrifices himself for the crew and gets reborn."}, {"start": 819.2059999999999, "end": 822.2059999999999, "text": "How captivating was Ricardo Montebon in that?"}, {"start": 822.2059999999999, "end": 825.2059999999999, "text": "Except in Abed's film, the character's name isn't Spock."}, {"start": 825.2059999999999, "end": 827.2059999999999, "text": "That's true."}, {"start": 827.2059999999999, "end": 828.2059999999999, "text": "It's Abed."}, {"start": 828.2059999999999, "end": 831.2059999999999, "text": "Oh, I'm getting creative goosebumps here."}, {"start": 831.2059999999999, "end": 833.2059999999999, "text": "I love Charlie Kaufman."}, {"start": 833.2059999999999, "end": 835.2059999999999, "text": "I need to run into editing for one second."}, {"start": 835.2059999999999, "end": 838.2059999999999, "text": "But if you want, we can grab you a chair and you can watch a take."}, {"start": 838.2059999999999, "end": 840.2059999999999, "text": "I would love that."}, {"start": 840.2059999999999, "end": 842.2059999999999, "text": "I've never watched a take before."}, {"start": 842.2059999999999, "end": 843.2059999999999, "text": "This is exciting."}, {"start": 843.2059999999999, "end": 846.2059999999999, "text": "Oh, you..."}, {"start": 846.2059999999999, "end": 850.2059999999999, "text": "Say what you will about Abed, but the man cannot be killed."}, {"start": 852.2059999999999, "end": 853.2059999999999, "text": "And he's almost like he's Jesus."}, {"start": 853.2059999999999, "end": 855.2059999999999, "text": "I got it."}, {"start": 855.2059999999999, "end": 857.2059999999999, "text": "I don't think we should be driving."}, {"start": 857.2059999999999, "end": 860.2059999999999, "text": "I mean, we're all, you know, old and groggy."}, {"start": 860.2059999999999, "end": 862.2059999999999, "text": "God, stop worrying."}, {"start": 862.2059999999999, "end": 865.2059999999999, "text": "Richard flew Zeros during the big one."}, {"start": 865.2059999999999, "end": 866.2059999999999, "text": "I mean, flew Zeros."}, {"start": 866.2059999999999, "end": 867.2059999999999, "text": "He's not Japanese."}, {"start": 867.2059999999999, "end": 870.2059999999999, "text": "Well, why didn't you fly during the big one, Rich?"}, {"start": 870.2059999999999, "end": 871.2059999999999, "text": "Where am I?"}, {"start": 871.2059999999999, "end": 873.2059999999999, "text": "Oh, come on, stop farting around."}, {"start": 873.2059999999999, "end": 876.2059999999999, "text": "Seriously, I don't know where I am."}, {"start": 876.2059999999999, "end": 879.2059999999999, "text": "What year was it?"}, {"start": 879.2059999999999, "end": 881.2059999999999, "text": "How do I drive?"}, {"start": 881.2059999999999, "end": 883.2059999999999, "text": "[screaming]"}, {"start": 883.2059999999999, "end": 885.2059999999999, "text": "Go ahead, give me it."}, {"start": 898.2059999999999, "end": 899.2059999999999, "text": "Let's bail."}, {"start": 899.2059999999999, "end": 900.2059999999999, "text": "Wait a minute, what about Richard?"}, {"start": 900.2059999999999, "end": 901.2059999999999, "text": "Screw Richard."}, {"start": 901.2059999999999, "end": 903.2059999999999, "text": "It's every man for himself."}, {"start": 903.2059999999999, "end": 906.2059999999999, "text": "I'll get out of here."}, {"start": 911.2059999999999, "end": 913.2059999999999, "text": "Richard, are you all right?"}, {"start": 913.2059999999999, "end": 916.2059999999999, "text": "Well, am I Richard?"}, {"start": 916.2059999999999, "end": 917.2059999999999, "text": "Yes."}, {"start": 917.2059999999999, "end": 919.2059999999999, "text": "Then I'm fine."}, {"start": 919.2059999999999, "end": 921.2059999999999, "text": "But who are those people that ran away?"}, {"start": 921.2059999999999, "end": 923.2059999999999, "text": "My friends?"}, {"start": 923.2059999999999, "end": 925.2059999999999, "text": "That's a good question."}, {"start": 925.2059999999999, "end": 927.2059999999999, "text": "Oh."}, {"start": 927.2059999999999, "end": 929.2059999999999, "text": "What is?"}, {"start": 929.2059999999999, "end": 931.2059999999999, "text": "There are no talks."}, {"start": 934.3420000000001, "end": 936.3420000000001, "text": "There is no few of them."}, {"start": 936.3420000000001, "end": 938.3420000000001, "text": "The film is the story."}, {"start": 938.3420000000001, "end": 940.3420000000001, "text": "The story is us."}, {"start": 940.3420000000001, "end": 943.3420000000001, "text": "We are the film."}, {"start": 944.3420000000001, "end": 947.3420000000001, "text": "So, what do you think?"}, {"start": 947.3420000000001, "end": 949.3420000000001, "text": "I need to take a walk."}, {"start": 952.3420000000001, "end": 958.3420000000001, "text": "Dear God, my movie is the worst piece of crap I have ever seen in my entire life."}, {"start": 969.1400000000001, "end": 971.1400000000001, "text": "How could I have been so blind?"}, {"start": 971.1400000000001, "end": 973.1400000000001, "text": "It's a self-indulgent adolescent mess."}, {"start": 973.1400000000001, "end": 976.1400000000001, "text": "I can barely sit through it."}, {"start": 976.1400000000001, "end": 980.1400000000001, "text": "And now with all this hype, I've got a real snake on a plane brewing."}, {"start": 980.1400000000001, "end": 982.1400000000001, "text": "The critics are going to crucify me."}, {"start": 982.1400000000001, "end": 985.1400000000001, "text": "My career will be over before it begins."}, {"start": 985.1400000000001, "end": 989.1400000000001, "text": "God, if you're out there, I know I don't deserve it, but I need your help."}, {"start": 989.1400000000001, "end": 991.1400000000001, "text": "Please take this project away from me."}, {"start": 991.1400000000001, "end": 993.1400000000001, "text": "Make it rain."}, {"start": 993.1400000000001, "end": 995.1400000000001, "text": "Send a meteor."}, {"start": 995.1400000000001, "end": 996.1400000000001, "text": "Anything?"}, {"start": 996.1400000000001, "end": 998.1400000000001, "text": "Please?"}, {"start": 998.1400000000001, "end": 999.1400000000001, "text": "Now?"}, {"start": 999.1400000000001, "end": 1000.1400000000001, "text": "Okay, I get it."}, {"start": 1004.9980000000003, "end": 1006.9980000000003, "text": "This is what I deserve."}, {"start": 1007.9980000000003, "end": 1009.9980000000003, "text": "I'll finish it up."}, {"start": 1035.9980000000003, "end": 1037.9980000000003, "text": "[Music]"}, {"start": 1065.9980000000003, "end": 1066.9980000000003, "text": "Hi."}, {"start": 1066.9980000000003, "end": 1068.9980000000003, "text": "I'm Pierce Hawthorne's emergency contact."}, {"start": 1068.9980000000003, "end": 1070.9980000000003, "text": "You're here to pick him up?"}, {"start": 1070.9980000000003, "end": 1072.9980000000003, "text": "Now I'm here to be removed as his emergency contact."}, {"start": 1072.9980000000003, "end": 1073.9980000000003, "text": "One second."}, {"start": 1073.9980000000003, "end": 1074.9980000000003, "text": "Hey!"}, {"start": 1074.9980000000003, "end": 1076.9980000000003, "text": "I got a class!"}, {"start": 1076.9980000000003, "end": 1078.9980000000003, "text": "Does anybody have any questions?"}, {"start": 1078.9980000000003, "end": 1080.9980000000003, "text": "Is anyone coming to get Leonard?"}, {"start": 1080.9980000000003, "end": 1081.9980000000003, "text": "No."}, {"start": 1081.9980000000003, "end": 1083.9980000000003, "text": "Nobody comes for him anymore."}, {"start": 1083.9980000000003, "end": 1086.9980000000003, "text": "His kids asked us to stop calling them."}, {"start": 1086.9980000000003, "end": 1089.9980000000003, "text": "Why do you think he acts like that?"}, {"start": 1093.9980000000003, "end": 1096.9980000000003, "text": "So, we're at prison, right?"}, {"start": 1098.9980000000003, "end": 1100.9980000000003, "text": "All right, bring him out."}, {"start": 1105.9980000000003, "end": 1107.9980000000003, "text": "Hey, go wait in the car."}, {"start": 1107.9980000000003, "end": 1108.9980000000003, "text": "What's it my fault?"}, {"start": 1108.9980000000003, "end": 1111.9980000000003, "text": "Go wait in the car."}, {"start": 1117.9980000000003, "end": 1118.9980000000003, "text": "You want me to change that or not?"}, {"start": 1118.9980000000003, "end": 1120.9980000000003, "text": "I guess not."}, {"start": 1120.9980000000003, "end": 1123.9980000000003, "text": "Uh, but, um, could you do me a favor?"}, {"start": 1123.9980000000003, "end": 1126.9980000000003, "text": "Could you add Britta Perry as a contact?"}, {"start": 1126.9980000000003, "end": 1128.9980000000003, "text": "P-E-R-R-Y?"}, {"start": 1128.9980000000003, "end": 1130.9980000000003, "text": "Would you give her a call a couple times a week?"}, {"start": 1130.9980000000003, "end": 1132.9980000000003, "text": "She gets pretty worried about him."}, {"start": 1132.9980000000003, "end": 1135.9980000000003, "text": "And, uh, she works days, so make sure you call at night."}, {"start": 1151.998, "end": 1154.998, "text": "Everyone thinks what you did was destined to happen."}, {"start": 1154.998, "end": 1157.998, "text": "That it was proof that God was making my movie."}, {"start": 1157.998, "end": 1159.998, "text": "A movie so good it could never exist."}, {"start": 1159.998, "end": 1161.998, "text": "They think I'm a genius and they think you're a villain."}, {"start": 1161.998, "end": 1162.998, "text": "Hmm?"}, {"start": 1162.998, "end": 1164.998, "text": "You heard me praying."}, {"start": 1167.612, "end": 1169.612, "text": "I don't know what you mean."}, {"start": 1169.612, "end": 1171.612, "text": "All this is gonna be good."}, {"start": 1171.612, "end": 1176.612, "text": "I'll bet send me a new link, and that man knows his video virality."}, {"start": 1176.612, "end": 1179.612, "text": "So, you're just gonna drop all pretense of actually teaching us."}, {"start": 1179.612, "end": 1180.237, "text": "Yeah."}, {"start": 1180.237, "end": 1181.612, "text": "Here we go."}, {"start": 1181.612, "end": 1184.612, "text": "Blessed be the peacemaker's word to the meek."}, {"start": 1184.612, "end": 1187.612, "text": "The kingdom of heaven is open all week."}, {"start": 1187.612, "end": 1189.612, "text": "You finished my movie."}, {"start": 1189.612, "end": 1191.612, "text": "I don't know what you mean."}, {"start": 1191.612, "end": 1193.612, "text": "Honey from the sink there, lepers have feet there,"}, {"start": 1193.612, "end": 1196.612, "text": "Dogs love cats there, cats love mice."}, {"start": 1196.612, "end": 1198.612, "text": "You humble me."}, {"start": 1198.612, "end": 1200.612, "text": "You humble me too."}, {"start": 1200.612, "end": 1202.612, "text": "The brownies and the tables are pies."}, {"start": 1202.612, "end": 1205.612, "text": "Ice cream is everywhere, but never on your thighs."}, {"start": 1205.612, "end": 1208.612, "text": "If your news is, it can be your good."}, {"start": 1208.612, "end": 1212.612, "text": "Okay, open your books, because all bed has broken the internet."}, {"start": 1212.612, "end": 1213.612, "text": "Word."}, {"start": 1213.612, "end": 1215.612, "text": "As a word of God, yo."}, {"start": 1221.208, "end": 1222.208, "text": "Great."}, {"start": 1222.208, "end": 1226.208, "text": "So, which one of us is gonna head home and change?"}, {"start": 1230.208, "end": 1231.208, "text": "Hilarious."}, {"start": 1231.208, "end": 1233.208, "text": "So, you guys bought one of my outfits,"}, {"start": 1233.208, "end": 1237.208, "text": "and then staked out my apartment every day until I wore it."}, {"start": 1237.208, "end": 1239.208, "text": "That is not pathetic."}, {"start": 1239.208, "end": 1240.208, "text": "Okay."}, {"start": 1240.208, "end": 1241.208, "text": "Well."}, {"start": 1241.208, "end": 1242.208, "text": "Well."}, {"start": 1242.208, "end": 1243.208, "text": "Good job."}, {"start": 1243.208, "end": 1244.208, "text": "Good job."}, {"start": 1244.208, "end": 1246.208, "text": "I guess I'm heading home AIDS now."}, {"start": 1246.208, "end": 1247.208, "text": "Now."}, {"start": 1247.208, "end": 1248.208, "text": "Oh, I hit traffic."}, {"start": 1248.208, "end": 1250.208, "text": "Did I miss it?"}, {"start": 1251.208, "end": 1252.208, "text": "Don't hit it!"}, {"start": 1252.208, "end": 1253.208, "text": "Don't hit it!"}]}